OL,9,G0500 Fletchers' Family Farm
OL,10,     FAgronomist Ben Clare arrives to
OL,11,     Fcheck on the farm's oats and
OL,12,     Fmaize, while Liz and Kelvin enjoy
OL,13,     Fan unusual date with a visit to
OL,14,     Flocal beekeepers. There is also a
OL,15,     Ffarewell as bull Ezra's time on
OL,16,     Fthe farm comes to an end and
OL,17,     FKelvin takes him to market in the
OL,18,     Fhope of finding him a new home
